2026-07-27T08:24:28.5384730Z i /tmp/Rtmpik3qBL/duckdb
2026-07-27T08:24:28.5385169Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T08:24:28.5385685Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T08:24:28.5386358Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T08:24:28.5387060Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T08:24:28.5388118Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T08:24:28.5388911Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
